WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,076 --> 00:00:03,228
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:03,278 --> 00:00:05,379
This is Episode 54.

3
00:00:05,429 --> 00:00:07,671
Maya has a lemonade stand.

4
00:00:07,721 --> 00:00:09,264
A few friends.

5
00:00:09,314 --> 00:00:10,341
Easy.

6
00:00:10,391 --> 00:00:11,865
Then more come.

7
00:00:11,915 --> 00:00:13,090
And more.

8
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:14,614
A big crowd!

9
00:00:14,664 --> 00:00:15,810
Oh no!

10
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:18,061
But the tall tower is watching.

11
00:00:18,111 --> 00:00:19,884
Its needle is green.

12
00:00:19,934 --> 00:00:21,269
Then yellow.

13
00:00:21,319 --> 00:00:22,584
Then red!

14
00:00:22,634 --> 00:00:24,118
Ding ding ding!

15
00:00:24,168 --> 00:00:25,653
The bell rings.

16
00:00:25,703 --> 00:00:27,157
Maya looks up.

17
00:00:27,207 --> 00:00:28,502
Too busy!

18
00:00:28,552 --> 00:00:30,942
She flips open a second stand.

19
00:00:30,992 --> 00:00:31,969
Pop!

20
00:00:32,019 --> 00:00:33,383
Two lines.

21
00:00:33,433 --> 00:00:34,897
Two stands.

22
00:00:34,947 --> 00:00:36,591
The needle drops.

23
00:00:36,641 --> 00:00:37,737
Yellow.

24
00:00:37,787 --> 00:00:38,842
Green.

25
00:00:38,892 --> 00:00:40,476
The bell stops.

26
00:00:40,526 --> 00:00:42,817
Later, the crowd goes home.

27
00:00:42,867 --> 00:00:44,959
Maya folds the stand away.

28
00:00:45,009 --> 00:00:46,254
One again.

29
00:00:46,304 --> 00:00:48,386
The tower watches the needle.

30
00:00:48,436 --> 00:00:50,429
The bell tells Maya when.

31
00:00:50,479 --> 00:00:52,331
That is the tall tower.

32
00:00:52,381 --> 00:00:54,433
Now you know CloudWatch!

33
00:00:54,483 --> 00:00:58,000
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!
